hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-18 : List (List Word)
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-18 = cons "In hyperactivity, every object is code: a value with a type, kept in a store under the hash of its content, with" (cons "names as a separate mapping from names to hashes. A node of a knowledge graph is such an object. Its type says what" (cons "kind of thing it is, and the type is checked, not labelled. Since the key is the content, two objects with the same" (cons "content are one object. Duplication of information is detectable by construction, and a reference can't silently" (cons "come to mean something else: change the content and you have a different key." (cons "" nil)))))
